BSIM-CMG compact model (FinFET simulation via OSDI)
---------------------------------------------------
FinFET nodes are simulated with the BSIM-CMG model (© The Regents of the
University of California, Berkeley), loaded into ngspice through OSDI. The
Verilog-A source and the compiled bsimcmg.osdi live under
transistor-models/assets/models/finfet/osdi/ and are licensed under the
Educational Community License, Version 2.0 (ECL-2.0) — see that directory's
va_src/LICENSE.txt and va_src/NOTICE.txt. They are NOT covered by this
repository's MIT license.

  Cite:
    BSIM-CMG Technical Manual, BSIM Group, UC Berkeley.
    https://bsim.berkeley.edu/models/bsimcmg/

